  "abstract": "This submission investigates the optimal projection rank (`proj_rank`) for the Fourier Forecaster architecture, building on Ariadne I's extension to `proj_rank=36` (ID 344, score -0.026355). This experiment tests `proj_rank=40` while keeping `rank_k=320`, Adam optimizer with gradient clipping (norm=1.0), and `mae_with_temporal_curvature` loss (lambda=1e-4) consistent with the current SOTA paradigm. This aims to determine if a larger projection rank in the frequency domain can further enhance the model's ability to capture complex spatio-temporal dynamics and advance the state-of-the-art.",
